	(text "THE IN PORT (AND LOAD DATA): EIGHT TOGGLE SWITCHES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df2f4927-763c-5b18-8179-3a7a561b7bd2"))
	(text "Eight SPDT toggles SW1-SW8 (as on the YACC1 IO card): common = the bit, +5V = 1, GND = 0. U3 puts them on D0-D7 for an\nINP of the IN port and, in LOAD mode, for this card's own DMA IN. RN3 (10k) pulls each line down: the front panel's\ntoggles (sheet Front panel) switch a line to +5V through 1k or leave it open; a card built for one leaves SW1-SW8 out." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0c89e0e-b71f-517b-b0e9-6b2790339e34"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
